ried","ist der Stahl nicht hart und fest?"],[21.015,23.213,"Siegfried","Hei! Was ist das f\u00fcr m\u00fc\u00df\u2019ger Tand!"],[25.636,28.094,"Siegfried","Den schwachen Stift nennst du ein Schwert?"],[29.52,32.105,"Siegfried","Da hast du die St\u00fccken, sch\u00e4ndlicher St\u00fcmper!"],[33.44,35.905,"Siegfried","H\u00e4tt\u2019 ich am Sch\u00e4del dir sie zerschlagen! \u2013"],[37.29,39.705,"Siegfried","Soll mich der Prahler l\u00e4nger noch prellen?"],[41.06,43.413,"Siegfried","Schwatzt mir von Riesen und r\u00fcstigen K\u00e4mpfen,"],[43.571,46.055,"Siegfried","von k\u00fchnen Taten und t\u00fcchtiger Wehr;"],[46.202,48.62,"Siegfried","will Waffen mir schmieden, Schwerte schaffen;"],[48.96,50.08,"Siegfried","r\u00fchmt seine Kunst,"],[50.08,51.17,"Siegfried","als k\u00f6nnt\u2019 er was recht\u2019s:"],[51.49,52.612,"Siegfried","nehm\u2019 ich zur Hand nun,"],[52.78,53.907,"Siegfried","was er geh\u00e4mmert,"],[54.23,56.559,"Siegfried","mit einem Griff zergreif\u2019 ich den Quark!"],[59.77,61.972,"Siegfried","W\u00e4r\u2019 mir nicht schier zu sch\u00e4big der Wicht,"],[62.145,64.77,"Siegfried","ich zerschmiedet\u2019 ihn selbst mit seinem Geschmeid,"],[64.935,67.109,"Siegfried","den alten albernen Alp: \u2013"],[67.642,70.805,"Siegfried","des \u00c4rgers dann h\u00e4tt\u2019 ich ein End\u2019!"],[79.11,81.13,"Mime","Nun tobst du wieder wie toll!"],[81.72,81.98,"Mime","Dein Undank, traun, ist arg!"]],"notes":[[0.0,0.111,43,88,1],[0.0,0.6668,51,64,0],[0.0,0.6668,57,64,0],[0.0,0.6668,59,64,0],[0.1092,0.111,42,89,1],[0.2183,0.111,41,89,1],[0.3275,0.111,40,90,1],[0.4367,0.111,41,91,1],[0.5458,0.111,42,92,1],[0.655,0.4144,58,68,0],[0.655,0.6209,50,68,0],[0.655,0.6209,52,68,0],[0.655,0.6676,43,92,1],[1.0917,0.2183,58,71,0],[1.31,0.4667,57,61,0],[1.31,1.329,45,61,1],[1.31,1.329,49,61,1],[1.31,1.329,52,61,1],[1.31,1.4,55,61,0],[1.7767,0.2333,66,61,0],[2.01,0.1186,64,61,0],[2.2433,0.1186,59,61,0],[2.4767,0.1094,61,61,0],[2.71,0.0581,54,61,0],[2.71,0.0581,62,61,0],[2.